  "note_on_screenshots": "AWS publishes real console screenshots inside its own News Blog and What's New posts. Those are compliant, citable and pixel-exact \u2014 the screenshot corpus previously written off as unobtainable. The /vpc/vpcs entry is the first corrected from that source, and it shows why this matters: the inferred list claimed 11 columns where the real table has 5, so the mock was being penalised against a fiction."
